 CellID->1625372718,ExpressionUUID->"a580fdf4-4712-4b92-8a59-a9cf2104d74f"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["ContractCGs"]], "paclet:Matchete/ref/ContractCGs", 
    "Matchete Package Symbol"},
   "PackageLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "2fce72ab-8a5f-4b77-b7cd-bdb1246fc841"],
 " finds each disjoint contraction of CGs in a terms, replaces the CGs with \
the numerical tensors and performs a tensor contraction to evaluate the \
Einstein summation of the indices. The resulting tensor is (attempted) \
projected onto a basis of previously defined CGs. If this is not possible \
(i.e. if the previously defined CGs do not form a basis), a new CG is \
initialized instead. Please refer to ",
 ButtonBox["CG Coefficients",
  BaseStyle->"Link",
  ButtonData->"paclet:Matchete/tutorial/CGCoefficients"],
 " for examples."
}], "Notes",
 CellID->1193914321,ExpressionUUID->"6d449296-594b-4d24-8d07-19b41fd5932e"]
}, Dynamic[CurrentValue[
 EvaluationNotebook[], {TaggingRules, "Openers", "NotesSection"}, Closed]]]],

