Two generators of the fundamental representation of SU(3) contracts to form a \
Kronecker delta:\
\>", "ExampleText",
 CellID->60218360,ExpressionUUID->"3bc86a4d-6677-48c0-a056-f3fb76fdf04e"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{"DefineGlobalGroup", "[", 
  RowBox[{"G", ",", " ", 
   RowBox[{"SU", "[", "3", "]"}]}], "]"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"CG", "[", 
